  "currentMode": "native",
  "measurements": "main-thread wall time, not GPU time; rendererCallMs times only renderer facade invocation, totalPresentationMs includes projection and pose resolution, displayFrameTotalMs times the entire eligible runDisplayFrame invocation (gameplay, clock/input/pose, projection, rendering, sync and UI), not exact gameplay.advance CPU; do not subtract nested wall times to infer scoring CPU; scored-hit deltas compare gameplay snapshots at app-frame entry/exit; pointerTotalMs measures the outer pointer-triggered presentation; wallElapsedMs includes menu/setup and MUST NOT be used for FPS; eligibleActiveMs sums only consecutive eligible display intervals, eligibleIntervalCount and ineligibleFrameCount expose coverage; 1-ms approximate p50/p95 histogram over every sample in each window; count and exact max cover the entire window; aftermath observed totals sum entries/pieces across render calls, not distinct frames; postHitBurst summarizes the union of scored-hit display frames and eligible display frames starting within 1200 ms after each scored hit, retaining aggregate histograms but no per-note records; display intervals are browser presentation cadence, not GPU time",
  "coverage": "valid windows require playing Test, Automatic Feedback OFF, visible selected hand, CV confirmed idle and stable reported backing/viewport/DPR; invalidReasons mark violations; compare hit counts/section manually; each window carries its own mode and session generation",
